        "v": [
          "He JC, Côté S. (2023) 'Are Empathic People Better Adjusted? A Test of Competing Models of Empathic Accuracy and Intrapersonal and Interpersonal Facets of Adjustment Using Self- and Peer Reports'. Psychological Science. V34(9):955-967. doi: 10.1177/09567976231185127"
